All true hackers know that the job "ain't" done yet until they have 
ascended under all twelve character classes. They know that there is 
nothing special about very high or low scores, since they know the
tricks to win games with such scores. It doesn't matter if you have
ascended in five, six, seven, or even eight of the character classes,
though such feats are commendable; instead, what counts is ascending
under all twelve classes, particularly the healer, tourist, and knight
classes. Anyone who has accomplished such a feat is a very special
person. I respect and salute all individuals who have attained this
goal.

 


